{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15464","headline":"戏赠韩判官绅卿 · 李端","name":"戏赠韩判官绅卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少寻道士居嵩岭，晚事高僧住沃洲。\n齿发未知何处老，身名且被外人愁。\n欲随山水居茅洞，已有田园在虎丘。\n独怪子猷缘掌马，雪时不肯更乘舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}